Package: pvs-monitoring
Architecture: any
# Declared so debhelper can inject any pre-dependency its generated maintainer
# scripts require — currently the dpkg-maintscript-helper rm_conffile calls from
# debian/pvs-monitoring.maintscript. On debhelper compat 13 this substvar expands
# to nothing (the helper needs dpkg >= 1.15.7.2, which predates every supported
# release), so the field is dropped from the built package; it is here so a
# future helper that does need one is not silently omitted.
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, curl, jq
Description: PVS6 solar monitor with MCP integration
 Monitors a SunPower PVS6 solar gateway via WebSocket,
 persists power readings to SQLite, and exposes data
 via MCP tools for use with Claude Desktop.
 .
 Includes systemd services for pvs-monitor, pvs-api, and pvs-ui.

